OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA warm, dry and bright day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells and light
OL,7,Fwinds. Clouding over in the evening
OL,8,Fperhaps with some outbreaks of rain.
OL,9,FSlightly warmer than Saturday.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,12,Ffrom the west during the evening with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain pushing across the
OL,14,Fregion during the early hours.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FTurning very warm and humid on
OL,17,FMonday with an increasing chance of
OL,18,Fshowers. These potentially thundery at
OL,19,Ftimes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
